  "mu_name": "Chaos Lightning Staff",
  "mu_name_from": "OpenMU Version075 Items/Weapons.cs:159 names group 5, index 7 the Chaos Lightning Staff; _enum.h:1601 MODEL_CHAOS_LIGHTNING_STAFF = MODEL_STAFF + 7, loaded from Item/Staff08.bmd, and mu.db's row (code 2567) agrees.",
  "why_this_one": "The Chaos Machine's Chaos Weapon recipe makes one of the three Chaos weapons (MixMgr.cpp:689, :1002); none of them drops (dropsFromMonsters false in the call), so without a mesh the recipe had nothing to make (2026-10-02).",
